# Local Python venvs & caches (stl-service) — untracked, can be 700MB+,
# never needed in the build context.
**/.venv
**/.venv*
**/__pycache__
apps/dashboard/services/stl-service/output
graphify-out

# Real .env files punya secret lokal — jangan pernah masuk build context.
# Next.js standalone output meng-copy .env yang ada di project dir ke
# .next/standalone, dan Dockerfile meng-copy standalone itu ke image final,
# jadi kalau tidak di-exclude di sini, secret bisa ke-bake ke image.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.deploy

# config.json printer-monitor berisi accessCode Bambu (secret) — jangan pernah masuk build context.
services/printer-monitor/config.json
